# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title #
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "What's next? {#whats-next}"
msgstr "Apa selanjutnya? {#whats-next}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Now that you’ve learned the fundamentals of quantum-safe cryptography, "
"explore the technologies IBM Quantum&reg; offers for modernizing your "
"cryptographic landscape and building quantum cyber resilience. [IBM Quantum "
"Safe&trade;](https://www.ibm.com/quantum/quantum-safe) is a comprehensive "
"set of tools, capabilities, and approaches combined with deep expertise to "
"help you plan and execute your organization’s migration to quantum-safe "
"cryptography. Discover, observe, and transform your cryptography with three "
"core technical capabilities:\n"
msgstr ""
"Sekarang setelah Anda mempelajari dasar-dasar kriptografi aman-kuantum, "
"jelajahi teknologi yang ditawarkan IBM Quantum&reg; untuk memodernisasi "
"lanskap kriptografi Anda dan membangun ketahanan siber kuantum. [IBM Quantum"
" Safe&trade;](https://www.ibm.com/quantum/quantum-safe) adalah sekumpulan "
"komprehensif alat, kemampuan, dan pendekatan yang dikombinasikan dengan "
"keahlian mendalam untuk membantu Anda merencanakan dan menjalankan migrasi "
"organisasi Anda ke kriptografi aman-kuantum. Temukan, amati, dan "
"transformasikan kriptografi Anda dengan tiga kemampuan teknis inti:\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "**1. IBM Quantum Safe Explorer**\n"
msgstr "**1. IBM Quantum Safe Explorer**\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"IBM Quantum Safe Explorer simplifies the discovery and management of "
"cryptography by performing source code and object code scanning to identify "
"all cryptographically relevant artifacts, uncover dependencies, and surface "
"vulnerabilities. Explorer represents this data in a [Cryptography Bill of "
"Materials](https://github.com/IBM/CBOM) (CBOM), a common extension to the "
"Software Bill of Materials (SBOM) that systematizes the creation and sharing"
" of metadata describing cryptographic artifacts.\n"
msgstr ""
"IBM Quantum Safe Explorer menyederhanakan penemuan dan manajemen kriptografi"
" dengan melakukan pemindaian kode sumber dan kode objek untuk "
"mengidentifikasi semua artefak yang relevan secara kriptografis, mengungkap "
"ketergantungan, dan menampilkan kerentanan. Explorer merepresentasikan data "
"ini dalam [Cryptography Bill of Materials](https://github.com/IBM/CBOM) "
"(CBOM), ekstensi umum untuk Software Bill of Materials (SBOM) yang "
"mensistematisasikan pembuatan dan berbagi metadata yang mendeskripsikan "
"artefak kriptografi.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "**2. IBM Quantum Safe Advisor**\n"
msgstr "**2. IBM Quantum Safe Advisor**\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"IBM Quantum Safe Advisor complements the static code analysis from IBM "
"Quantum Safe Explorer with a dynamic, runtime perspective of your "
"cryptographic posture and compliance. Advisor correlates [CBOMs][CBOM] and "
"aggregates data from network and endpoint scans to build a comprehensive "
"cryptographic inventory. This inventory details:\n"
msgstr ""
"IBM Quantum Safe Advisor melengkapi analisis kode statis dari IBM Quantum "
"Safe Explorer dengan perspektif runtime yang dinamis tentang postur dan "
"kepatuhan kriptografi Anda. Advisor mengkorelasikan [CBOM][CBOM] dan "
"mengagregasi data dari pemindaian jaringan dan endpoint untuk membangun "
"inventaris kriptografi yang komprehensif. Inventaris ini merinci:\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "The types and locations of your cryptographic instances\n"
msgstr "Jenis dan lokasi instansi kriptografi Anda\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Associated certificates, cipher suites, and CBOMs\n"
msgstr "Sertifikat, cipher suite, dan CBOM yang terkait\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "The relationships between assets and data flows\n"
msgstr "Hubungan antara aset dan aliran data\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Potential vulnerabilities to quantum technology\n"
msgstr "Potensi kerentanan terhadap teknologi kuantum\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"With its policy-based enrichment, Advisor equips you to evaluate your "
"cryptography and data compliance and generate a prioritized list of "
"vulnerabilities so that you can establish a quantum-safe remediation "
"strategy.\n"
msgstr ""
"Dengan pengayaan berbasis kebijakan, Advisor membekali Anda untuk "
"mengevaluasi kriptografi dan kepatuhan data Anda serta menghasilkan daftar "
"kerentanan yang diprioritaskan sehingga Anda bisa menetapkan strategi "
"remediasi aman-kuantum.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "**3. IBM Quantum Safe Remediator**\n"
msgstr "**3. IBM Quantum Safe Remediator**\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"IBM Quantum Safe Remediator enables you to apply best practices for quantum-"
"safe remediation patterns focused on VPN communication, TLS communication, "
"and cluster access communication. Build crypto-agility by exploring "
"solutions for transforming your cryptography without disrupting business "
"operations.\n"
msgstr ""
"IBM Quantum Safe Remediator memungkinkan Anda menerapkan praktik terbaik "
"untuk pola remediasi aman-kuantum yang berfokus pada komunikasi VPN, "
"komunikasi TLS, dan komunikasi akses cluster. Bangun crypto-agility dengan "
"mengeksplorasi solusi untuk mentransformasi kriptografi Anda tanpa "
"mengganggu operasi bisnis.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Read the [technology guide](https://www.ibm.com/quantum/assets/quantum-"
"safe/IBM_Quantum-Safe-Technology-Brochure.pdf), and learn more on the [IBM "
"Quantum Safe site.](https://www.ibm.com/quantum/quantum-safe)\n"
msgstr ""
"Baca [panduan teknologi](https://www.ibm.com/quantum/assets/quantum-"
"safe/IBM_Quantum-Safe-Technology-Brochure.pdf), dan pelajari lebih lanjut di"
" [situs IBM Quantum Safe.](https://www.ibm.com/quantum/quantum-safe)\n"

